// The SHIPPED entry (no third argument: today's list is what is under test). The advisory sits on picomatch; the dev tools that reach it are paths.
describe("the shipped exception: picomatch GHSA-fc5q-39xc-vjpf (the product owner's 2026-11-18 ruling)", () => {
